\section{Not yet verified}{
The spec records these as open. They are listed rather than hidden:

\itemize{
\item PUSH-TO-MAINLAND: TmtDesign.txt is MetaMorpheus's name (GlobalVariables.TmtExperimentalDesignFileName), and mzLib publishes no constant for it at d10017ce, so the bridge holds the one copy (Sdrf.TmtDesignFileName). Ask mzLib for SdrfIsobaricDesign.TmtDesignFileName, or a WriteTmtDesign overload that takes the folder, and read the name from there.
\item No \code{--paths-stdin} form, for the reason sdrf design gives: the kit, the plex source, the condition columns and the searched files are per-deposit facts.
\item mzLib's quantification design (ToExperimentalDesign: every kit channel with its reporter m/z, an unannotated one with biological replicate 0) is not projected. Add it when a bridge verb quantifies reporter ions from it.
}
}
